      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "As the title says, Once again RLE Group do a fantastic job.  June 2024 Ryan installed a solar system for us 19.8kW 3 phase with SMA inverter - go check my review.This time I was looking to add a battery, like every other person in the country after the Govt rebate.  Originally I had toyed withthe idea of adding some RUiXU batteries as they looked at good price point - but were waiting for CeC approval.Ryan said with the Govt rebate Sigenergy was a good option, so I spent some time investigating.  Brilliant!  Ryan came to the party and gave me quotes for 16 & 24 kWh options.  In the end I went with 32kWh and the install was done with no issues.  So now I have my SMA AC coupled with my Sigenergy/SigStor giving me heaps of electrons.Yesterday was a nice day and my SMA spat out 98.8 kWh of electrons.  I sold 66.37 to the grid and got $6.63 the grid sold me $0.11 - Happy with that.Ryan did a great job with his team.  He certainly knows what he is doing.  Look no further.",
