      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process was good, friendly and receptive to questions, installation was okay, reasonably tidy, gave the impression of being across everything experience wise, but by the the time the job and some extra work was completed I wasn’t so sure.A concrete garden ornament was broken in the process, suspect very new apprentices where responsible but no admission forth coming.On the day of completion I was  given the strong impression grid connection would be fairly straightforward, this turned out to be incorrect, it resulted in a he said she said situation between the installer and the power provider, after 3 interventions by me it was finally resolved, 10 working days later I was allowed to switch it on.No follow up contact re operation since installation.My advice would be if using Solar quotes read the reviews on the installers they put forward, I didn’t do this, my fault.",
